# Manifold level 10
# The tower's entrance (stage 5b): a floor to prove the games' shell, not one of the tower's own (5d
# builds those by the gym's measures). Up a stair onto platforms a meter up, across a gap of 3 m (a
# walking jump carries 5.9 m: the far side is 6 m deep), up a stair to the goal 2 m up; a star on two
# blocks 2 m high beside the gap, jumped onto from the ground (2.2 m at most: the gym).
title The entrance
spawn 0 1 6
facing 0 0 -1
sky 18.75

kit floor_4  -4 0 6
kit floor_4  0 0 6
kit floor_4  4 0 6
kit floor_4  -4 0 2
kit floor_4  0 0 2
kit floor_4  4 0 2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -2
kit floor_4  0 0 -2
kit floor_4  4 0 -2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -6
kit floor_4  0 0 -6
kit floor_4  4 0 -6
kit floor_4  -4 0 -10
kit floor_4  0 0 -10
kit floor_4  4 0 -10
kit floor_4  -4 0 -14
kit floor_4  0 0 -14
kit floor_4  4 0 -14
kit floor_4  -4 0 -18
kit floor_4  0 0 -18
kit floor_4  4 0 -18
kit floor_4  -4 0 -22
kit floor_4  0 0 -22
kit floor_4  4 0 -22

kit stairs_1    0 0 0
kit platform_2  0 0 -2
kit platform_2  0 0 -4
kit platform_2  0 0 -10
kit platform_2  0 0 -12
kit platform_2  0 0 -14
kit stairs_1    0 1 -16
kit platform_2  0 1 -18
kit platform_2  0 1 -20
kit block_1     3 0 -7
kit block_1     3 1 -7

